  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 406.06 Obligation to be Honest and Candid. Licensees shall be candid and truthful when:\n\n(a) Making oral and written statements to the board and the OPLC; and\n\n(b) Making oral and written statements about athletic training to the public.\n\nSource. #9099, eff 3-1-08; renumbered by #10228, (from Ath 405.06); ss by #10921, eff 8-29-15; ss by #14247, eff 5-16-25, EXPIRES: 5-16-35",
